```console
$ scherzo-cloud run inputs download --help
Download and verify retained input members atomically

Usage: scherzo-cloud run inputs download [OPTIONS] --output <DIRECTORY> <ORGANIZATION> <RUN>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUN>           Exact Run ID

Options:
      --output <DIRECTORY>             New destination directory for logical input member paths
      --member <MEMBER>                Download one exact logical member (repeat to select more)
      --json                           Print the run result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
